e","en":"The moon"},{"fr":"Une étoile","en":"A star"},{"fr":"Le soleil","en":"The sun"},{"fr":"Un lac","en":"A lake"}],"answer":2,"why":{"fr":"« zuǒ yǎn biànchéng le tàiyáng » ; l'œil droit devient la lune.","en":"“zuǒ yǎn biànchéng le tàiyáng”; the right eye becomes the moon."}},{"q":{"fr":"Que devient le sang de Pangu ?","en":"What does Pangu's blood become?"},"options":[{"fr":"Les montagnes","en":"The mountains"},{"fr":"Les rivières","en":"The rivers"},{"fr":"La pluie","en":"The rain"},{"fr":"Le tonnerre","en":"Thunder"}],"answer":1,"why":{"fr":"« tā de xiě biànchéng le chángcháng de hé » : de longues rivières.","en":"“tā de xiě biànchéng le chángcháng de hé”: long rivers."}}],"chars":487}